---
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<title>PI-HUB | AI-Powered Passive Income Infrastructure</title>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 font-sans">
		<nav class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-6 flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-800">
			<h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-blue-500">PI-HUB</h1>
			<a href="#contact" class="bg-blue-600 px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-blue-700">Get Started</a>
		</nav>

		<main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
			<section class="text-center">
				<h2 class="text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight">Scale Your Digital Income with <br/> <span class="text-blue-500">Automated Web Assets</span></h2>
				<p class="text-xl text-slate-400 mt-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">From micro-niche sites to premium templates and managed WaaS—we build, manage, and scale your digital portfolio while you sleep.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="mt-24 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
				<div class="bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🚀 Niche Site Factory</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-400">Automated SEO research, content generation, and deployment of high-performing micro-sites.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🎨 Template Marketplace</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-400">High-end, performance-optimized Astro/Tailwind templates crafted for developers and agencies.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🌐 Managed WaaS</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-400">Professional, hands-off website solutions for your small business clients with monthly hosting and SEO.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
            
            <section id="contact" class="mt-24 bg-blue-900 p-12 rounded-3xl text-center">
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold">Ready to Start?</h3>
                <p class="text-blue-100 mt-4">Let's discuss how PI-HUB can automate your next revenue stream.</p>
                <form class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4">
                    <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-slate-900" />
                    <button class="bg-white text-blue-900 px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold">Request Consultation</button>
                </form>
            </section>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
